SUMMARY: North Humber River Long Walk  - 16KM (You might see a deer!)
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n### 
 🌿 North Humber River Walk – 6th Annual! 🌿\n\nWe’re back for our 
 **sixth year in a row** with this incredible walk — and it has become a 
 true fan favourite!\nThe North Humber River trail is one of Toronto’s mo
 st peaceful and nature-filled walks. It’s a longer walk\, but that’s p
 art of what makes it so rewarding.\n\nYou’ll get out of the city\, follo
 w the river\, explore beautiful natural areas\, and see just how far you c
 an go when you give yourself the chance.\n\nThis walk is about challenging
  yourself just a little — you'd be surprised how far you can go!\nIf you
  don't want to complete the entire walk\, that's totally okay. You can lea
 ve along the way\, and I can help you find the nearest way back toward pub
 lic transit.\nWe'll finish with a quick stop at Tim Hortons before heading
  back toward Kipling Station.\n\n### 📲 Stay Connected\n\nDon't forget t
 o join our **WhatsApp Group – [CLICK HERE!](https://chat.whatsapp.com/H5
 9mSCbsAi018gYANrKAnc)**\nIt's a great way to get updates\, connect with ot
 her members\, and stay informed about the event.\n\n***\n\n###\n\n***\n\n#
 ## 📍 Meetup Details\n\n🕙 **Meetup Time:** 10:00 AM\n🚌 **Bus leave
 s:** 10:06 AM sharp\n📍 **Meetup Spot:** In front of the Information Boo
 th at Kipling Subway Station Bus Terminal\n🫎 Look for Mathew in the Moo
 se Hat!\n🚌 **Bus:** 927B Highway 27 Express to Steeles via Humber Colle
 ge\n\n⚠️ **PLEASE BE ON TIME.**\nIf you miss the bus\, you will miss t
 he group. We cannot wait for late arrivals.\n\n***\n\n### 🚗 Driving / M
 eeting Us at the Trail\n\nIf you live closer to the trail or prefer to dri
 ve\, **you can meet us at Humberline Park**.\n📍 **Meeting Point:** Humb
 erline Park\, by the bathrooms\n⏰ **Meeting Time:** Approximately **10:3
 5 AM**\n\nPlease look up directions to Humberline Park before leaving and 
 give yourself plenty of time to get there.\n🚗 **Parking:** Parking avai
 lability in the area can vary\, so please check the parking situation befo
 re coming.\n\n⚠️ **Important:** If you drive to Humberline Park\, **yo
 u will need to arrange your own transportation back at the end of the walk
 .**\n\nWe do not finish the walk back at Humberline Park. You may need to 
 use Uber\, a taxi\, or public transit to get back to your vehicle.\nIf you
 're meeting us at the park\, please make sure you are there and ready to w
 alk by 10:35 AM. Once we arrive\, we'll be continuing with the group.\n\n*
 **\n\n### 💵 Meetup Fee\n\n**$5 cash in person or e-transfer**\n📧 **[
 mathewmaclean@hotmail.com](mailto:mathewmaclean@hotmail.com)**\n\nThis sma
 ll fee helps support the group and keeps events like this running. Thank y
 ou for supporting the community!\n\n***\n\n### 🌲 What to Expect\n\n🚍
  A 40-minute bus ride to the starting point near Humber College\n🌿 A pe
 aceful walk along the North Humber River\n🦌 Opportunities to spot deer\
 , birds\, and other wildlife\n☕ Two rest stops along the route\n🥾 A l
 onger walk that will give you a chance to challenge yourself\n🍩 A final
  stop at Tim Hortons before heading back toward Kipling Station\n\nSome se
 ctions of this trail genuinely feel like you've left Toronto behind. It's 
 one of those walks where the city slowly disappears and you're surrounded 
 by trees\, water\, wildlife\, and open space.\n\n***\n\n### 🧳 What to B
 ring\n\n💧 Water\n👟 Good walking shoes — some sections may be uneve
 n\n🥨 A snack\n🧴 Sunscreen\n🎒 A small backpack\n\n***\n\n### 👥 
 Who Is This For?\n\nThis group is for anyone who wants to get outside\, ex
 plore Toronto\, and meet people along the way — singles\, couples\, newc
 omers\, longtime Torontonians\, and everyone in between.\n\nWe host:\n🎬
  Movies\n🚶 Walks & hikes\n🎭 Arts & culture\n🍽️ Restaurants\n
 🎤 Karaoke\n…and plenty more!\n\nThe activity is the **container**. Th
 e people you meet and the connections you make along the way are the real 
 experience. 💛\n\n***\n\n### 💛 A Few Notes\n\nYou're welcome to join 
 us even if you're deciding at the last minute.\nIf you need to leave the w
 alk early\, that's okay — just let me know and we'll help you figure out
  the best way to get back toward transit.\nSometimes things happen and eve
 nts may need to be cancelled or changed. Please keep an eye on the event p
 age for updates.\n\n***\n\n👤 **Organizer: Mathew**\n📧 Questions? Pos
 t on the event wall or email:\n**[torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com](mai
 lto:torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com)**
