SUMMARY:Taylor-Massey Creek & Don River Walk + Ice Cream 🌳🍦9KM
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n## **Ta
 ylor-Massey Creek & Don River Walk + Ice Cream** 🌳🍦\n\n**Taylor-Mass
 ey Creek** is a tributary of the Don River\, winding its way through Scarb
 orough and East York before meeting the Don. Named after two prominent Tor
 onto families\, the Taylors were well-known for owning and operating the h
 istoric Don Valley Brick Works.\n\nThis walk takes us along the scenic **T
 aylor-Massey Creek Trail**\, through the **Don Valley**\, and ends with a 
 challenging hill climb before rewarding ourselves with **ice cream at Dair
 y Queen**. If ice cream isn’t your thing\, you can continue with the gro
 up toward Broadview Station.\n\n📲Don't forget to join our **WhatsApp Gr
 oup – [CLICK HERE!](https://chat.whatsapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANrKAnc)**\
 n\n***\n\n### **🕰 Meetup Details**\n\n**Start Location:** Outside the m
 ain entrance of Victoria Park Station (on Victoria Park Road). Look for me
  in my Moose Hat 🦌.\n\n**End Point:** Near Broadview Station *(we will 
 not be returning to Victoria Park)*.\n\n***\n\n### **💵 Meetup Fee**\n\n
 **$5 cash in person** or **e-transfer** to: **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**\
 n\n***\n\n### **🥾 What to Bring**\n\n* Water 💧\n* Comfortable walkin
 g shoes 👟\n* A snack 🥪\n* Bathroom breaks are limited — there’s 
 only one near the very end of the walk.\n\n***\n\n### **🚶 Pace & Flexib
 ility**\n\nWe’ll be leaving Victoria Park at a steady walking pace\, but
  you can leave anytime you like.\n\n***\n\n### **Please Notes**\n\n* Occas
 ionally events need to be cancelled — please check for updates before he
 ading out.\n* You can **RSVP in advance or just show up** if you’re unsu
 re you can make it.\n* This group is open to **everyone** — single\, cou
 pled\, shy\, social\, new in town\, or a long-time local.\n\nWe also host 
 **movies\, hikes\, arts & culture\, restaurants**\, and more — come be p
 art of it!\n\n📧 **Contact Mathew (Organizer):** Post a message on the w
 all or email **torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com**\n\n**Come for the tra
 ils.**\n**Stay for the ice cream.**\n**Leave with a new connection — and
  maybe a new friend.** 🌳🍦💛
