SUMMARY:Niagara Falls at night by casino bus. With fireworks\, more
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\nThis tr
 ip's for the adventurous night owls. Summer is almost over and it's time t
 o check out this lovely natural wonder of the world\, Niagara Falls.\n\nWe
 'll be headed there on comfortable [Safeway Tours bus](https://safewaytour
 s.net/casino). With free wifi and onboard bathroom.\n\nNOTE - It's up to y
 ou to contact Safeway Tours and book your spot on the bus. Long weekends a
 re busy so highly recommend you make a reservation\n\nnote- you can call S
 afeway Tours from Aug 30 onwards to book your spot. they only take reserva
 tions one week ahead of a trip\n\n**Cost** - **50 cash.** Must bring **cas
 h** for the [casino bus](%5Bhttps://safewaytours.net/casino%5D(https://saf
 ewaytours.net/casino)). Once you arrive at the casino they will give you 4
 0 in casino credit that you can play with and \, hopefully\, grow even big
 ger.\n\nAlso bring government ID\, cash\, credit \, debit for whatever you
  plan to eat\,drink \, gamble\, etc.\n\nWhatsApp for this trip\n\n[https:/
 /chat.whatsapp.com/FqraC7g3zH94bVl6Q4teZY](https://chat.whatsapp.com/FqraC
 7g3zH94bVl6Q4teZY)\n\nJoin the main [Whatapps group ](https://chat.whatsap
 p.com/JpUbpvfPcNuFzTJ1VqTLZO) for discussions\, questions\, etc regarding 
 our group\n\n**Itinerary** \\- Meet at Broadview/Gerrard to take the **6PM
  Safeway Tours bus** to Niagara Falls. Do not be late\, bus won't wait.\n\
 n[https://safewaytours.net/casino?view=1](https://safewaytours.net/casino?
 view=1)\n\n8:30PM - arrive at Niagara Falls\n\nMy plan is to walk down Cli
 fton Hill \, look at amusements along the way\, then head closer to the Fa
 lls.\n\n[https://www.niagarafallstourism.com/play/attractions/](https://ww
 w.niagarafallstourism.com/play/attractions/)\n\nThen around 10PM we gather
  once more to watch the lovely free fireworks display over the Falls.\n\n[
 https://www.niagarafallstourism.com/fireworks/](https://www.niagarafallsto
 urism.com/fireworks/)\n\nAfter fireworks you have a few options. Take the 
 12:30AM return bus\,\nor stay later for the 3AM return bus\, provided spac
 e is available on it (not guaranteed).\n\nOn trip back our bus stops at Br
 emner /Spadina (by request) \, Spadina/ Dundas\, College/Yonge\, and then 
 final stop is Broadview /Gerrard\n\n**Q - Can I drive instead?**\n\nA - No
 t for this one. Tricky to coordinate driver and bus passengers\n\n**Q - Wh
 at should I bring?**\n\nA - **Government issued ID. Must be 19+ for the bu
 s.** Weather appropriate clothing\, trip goes rain or shine. $50 cash for 
 casino bus . Stuff for the bus ride (neck pillow\, snacks\, charging cable
 \, battery pack\, headphones)\n\nComfortable walking shoes. We'll be walki
 ng everywhere once we get to the Falls.\n\n**Q - Can I come back on later 
 3AM bus?**\n\nA - Yes but only if they have room. Your guaranteed return s
 pot is on the 12:30AM bus.\n\n**Q - Can I stay overnight?**\n\nA - Yes. Yo
 u are responsible for booking your own hotel and changing your return time
  with Safeway Tours. The next bus back to Toronto on Monday Sept 7\n\nCons
 ider joining our [Whatsapp](https://chat.whatsapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANrKA
 nc?mode=ac_t) to discuss this and future events too\n\n**PLEASE REVIEW RUL
 ES:** [CLICK HERE!](https://www.meetup.com/Toronto-Movies-and-Outings-Grou
 p/pages/6014492/Rules/)\n\n**REMEMBER YOU CAN JUST SHOW UP ON THE DAY OF E
 VENT IF YOU ARE NOT SURE YOU CAN MAKE IT.**\n\n**NOTE:** Sometimes things 
 happen and I might have to cancel so please keep a look out for that!\n\n*
 *Don't Forget to join our email list** (Meetup does not send out emails to
 \neveryone in a group) to get our weekly news later about upcoming events:
  [http://eepurl.com/hKt76f](http://eepurl.com/hKt76f)\n\n*Nicolas is the o
 rganizer for this meetup. If you need to contact him\, please post a messa
 ge on the wall\, or email him at* nicolasbello@yahoo.com
