SUMMARY:🎷 Try Something Different: Advocats Big Band at The Duke Live! 
 🎶
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 🎷 
 Try Something Different: Advocats Big Band at The Duke Live! 🎶\n\n**Mon
 day\, September 7 • 6:00 PM**\n\nLet’s try something a little differen
 t! For the first time with our Meetup group\, we’re heading to **The Duk
 e Live** for an evening of **BIG BAND music** featuring one of my favourit
 e local bands — **The Advocats Big Band!** 🎺🎷🥁\n\nThe Advocats 
 bring a fun mix of big-band jazz\, swing and classic tunes\, with a full e
 nsemble featuring horns\, rhythm section and vocals. They regularly perfor
 m at The Duke\, and this Labour Day show runs from **6:00–8:30 PM**.\n\n
 ### 🍻 What to Expect\n\nNick will be arriving **earlier than 6:00 PM** 
 to grab a good spot and get settled.\nThere is **food and drink available 
 for purchase** at The Duke\, so come hungry or thirsty and make an evening
  of it!\n\n🎟️ **Tickets: $20 cash at the door**\n💻 Or purchase you
 r ticket online in advance:\n[🎟️ Get Tickets on Eventbrite](https://w
 ww.eventbrite.ca/e/advocats-big-band-presented-by-the-duke-live-tickets-19
 98617507767?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**There is no Meetup fee for this e
 vent**\n\n**Not sure about your schedule yet? No problem!** You can simply
  show up and join us. There’s no need to commit to the whole evening —
  just come by\, find us and enjoy some live music.\n\n### 📍 Where?\n\n*
 *The Duke Live**\n1225 Queen Street East\, at Leslie\nThe Queen streetcar 
 stops right in front of the venue\, and there is parking nearby.\n\n👋 *
 *Look for the Meetup signs on our table!**\n\n### 🎵 Want to hear what t
 hey're like?\n\nCheck out the Advocats on YouTube before you come and get 
 a taste of their style:\n[▶️ Watch the Advocats on YouTube](https://ww
 w.youtube.com/watch?v=VFXsMBcia90&utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nCome out\, gr
 ab a drink\, enjoy some food\, meet some new people and listen to a **17-p
 iece big band** on Labour Day evening!\n\n**Let's give something new a try
 ! 🎷🍻🎶**
