SUMMARY:🎤🏝️ KARAOKE AT THE TORONTO ISLANDS! — OUR FIRST EVER! 
 🌅🎶
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 🎤
 🏝️ KARAOKE AT THE TORONTO ISLANDS! — OUR FIRST EVER! 🌅🎶\n\n**
 Friday\\\, September 11 \\| Karaoke starts at 8:00 PM**\nWe're doing somet
 hing we've **never done before** — taking our Meetup karaoke night to th
 e **Toronto Islands!** 🏝️🎤\n\nJoin us for an unforgettable evening
  of music\, laughs\, drinks\, and summer vibes at the **Toronto Island Mar
 ina & Yacht Club**\, with [karaoke hosted by the fantastic ](https://toron
 toislandmarina.com/event/karaoke-with-ivan-rivers/?instance_id=558)**[Ivan
  Rivers](https://torontoislandmarina.com/event/karaoke-with-ivan-rivers/?i
 nstance_id=558)**[!](https://torontoislandmarina.com/event/karaoke-with-iv
 an-rivers/?instance_id=558)\nWhat better way to say **BYE BYE TO SUMMER** 
 than singing your favourite songs on the Islands? ☀️🎶\n\n### 🏝
 ️ GETTING TO THE ISLANDS\n\nWe will be taking the 7PM ferry to Centre Is
 lands.\n\nIf you're arriving later you'll need to get to Marina on your ow
 n.\n\n👉 **Check the ferry schedule here:**\n[Toronto Island Ferry Route
 s & Schedules](https://www.toronto.ca/explore-enjoy/toronto-island-ferries
 /ferry-routes-schedules/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**Important:** Give yo
 urself plenty of time to get to the ferry terminal and board the boat. Fer
 ry lineups can vary\, especially on a summer evening.\nOnce you arrive at 
 **Centre Island**\, make your way toward the **[Toronto Island Marina & Ya
 cht Club](https://torontoislandmarina.com/event/karaoke-with-ivan-rivers/?
 instance_id=558)**[.](https://torontoislandmarina.com/event/karaoke-with-i
 van-rivers/?instance_id=558)\n\n🚶‍♂️ Follow the signs toward the 
 marina and **look for our Meetup signs on the tables**. That's where you'l
 l find our group!\n\n### 🎤 KARAOKE STARTS AT 8:00 PM!\n\nWe'll be settl
 ing in at the Marina & Yacht Club before karaoke gets underway at **8 PM**
 .\n\n🎶 Hosted by **Ivan Rivers**\n🎤 Your favourite songs\n😂 Plent
 y of laughs\n🏝️ An amazing Island setting\n🌃 Toronto skyline views
 \n☀️ One last big summer night!\n\nWhether you're the person who immed
 iately grabs the microphone or the person who says *"I'm just here to watc
 h"* before eventually getting talked into singing — **come join us!** 
 😆\n\n### 📱 FINDING THE GROUP\n\nAll **registered Meetup attendees wi
 ll have Nick's phone number** so you can contact him if you have trouble f
 inding the group or need assistance getting to our tables.\nPlease make su
 re your phone is charged!\n\n### ⚠️ A FEW THINGS TO KNOW\n\n• **RSVP
  is important** — please register if you're planning to attend.\n• **C
 heck the ferry schedule before leaving home.**\n• Allow extra time for f
 erry lineups and the walk from Centre Island to the marina.\n• Wear comf
 ortable shoes — you'll be walking on the Island.\n• Keep an eye on the
  weather and dress appropriately for an evening outdoors.\n• Don't forge
 t your phone! 📱\n• And most importantly… **come ready to have FUN!*
 * 🎉\nThis is our **FIRST-EVER Toronto Islands karaoke night**\, so let'
 s make it a good one!\n\nUnsure of your schedule? You can just show up for
  this one .\n\n🏝️ **Toronto Islands + 🎤 Karaoke + 🎶 Great music
  + 😂 Great people = one heck of a summer send-off!**\n\n**Let's say BYE
  BYE TO SUMMER in style!** ☀️🍂🎤\n**See you on the Islands!**
