SUMMARY:🌳🚶‍♂️ Eglinton West Trail & Mimico Creek + Swiss Chale
 t 🍗! 12KM
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n**🌳
 🚶‍♂️ Eglinton West Trail & Mimico Creek + Swiss Chalet 🍗**\n\n
 Golden trails\, sparkling creek\, great conversation… and Swiss Chalet a
 fter 🍗. We’re walking **Eglinton West & Mimico Creek** this weekend 
 — once it’s over\, it’s gone. Meet awesome people\, get fresh air\, 
 and make memories you *won’t* get sitting at home 💬☀️.\n\n📱 Do
 n't forget to join our **WhatsApp Group – [CLICK HERE](https://chat.what
 sapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANrKAnc)**\n\n**📍 Meetup Details**\n🚌 **Star
 t:** We’ll begin by taking the **73 Bus** to Eglinton West.\n\n🚶‍
 ♀️ **Route:** Follow the city trail until we reach Mimico Creek\, take
  a short park break 🌳\, then continue back to **Royal York Subway Stati
 on** 🚇.\n\n📌 **Location:** Inside Royal York Subway Station — by t
 he stairs on the bus platform. Look for me in my 🦌 Moose Hat!\n\n⏰ **
 Time:** We leave with the **10:55am bus** — I will only wait until depar
 ture.\n\n💵 **Fee:** $5 cash 💰 or e-transfer to **mathewmaclean@hotma
 il.com**\n\n**🎒 What to Bring:**\n💧 Water\n👟 Good walking shoes\n
 🥪 Snack\n\n🚻 Bathroom stop before you arrive (there *may* be facilit
 ies on the walk\, but not guaranteed)\n🏁 **End Spot:** Back at Royal Yo
 rk Subway Station\n\n🕒 **Leaving Time:** Anytime you like — your pace
 \, your choice!\n\n**⚠️ Notes:**\n\n* Plans can change — please chec
 k for possible cancellations 🔔.\n* You can **just show up** if you’re
  not sure until the last minute.\n\n💬 This group is open to *everyone* 
 — singles\, couples\, social butterflies 🦋\, and anyone who wants to 
 meet great people. We also host 🎥 movies\, 🥾 hikes\, 🎭 arts & cul
 ture outings\, and more.**[!](https://chat.whatsapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANr
 KAnc)**\n\n📩 **Organizer:** Mathew — post a message on the wall or em
 ail **torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com** for questions.\n\n**Come for t
 he trails.**\n**Stay for lunch.**\n**Leave with a new connection — and m
 aybe a new friend.** 🌳🍦💛
